  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix ingredients, except Trace vitamins and NaHCO3, and adjust pH to 7.0. Distribute the medium into culture vessels (e.g., 20 ml of medium in 120 mlserum bottles) under a stream of N2--CO2 (4:1, v/v) gas mixture, seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave. Filter--sterilize Trace vitamins and 5% NaHCO3 solution and add to the medium. Finally add O2 gas to make 5% (v/v) in the gas phase."
    }
  ]
}